    "updated_at": "2026-05-30T15:05:54Z",
    "body": "FWIW, the I18N WG recommends W3C specs [use a specific template](https://www.w3.org/TR/international-specs/#char_ref_unicode_template) when referencing specific Unicode code points (or short sequences), on first occurrence/definition. WHATWG is less consistent about doing this. You might consider adopting something similar.",
